      "text": "During construction, the Main Building’s first-floor ATM, unattended 24-hour store, Campus Store, and cafe are closed and should be excluded from recommendations. Users should use the West Complex ATM via a route avoiding the construction zone, or the Engineering Building Campus Store from 7:00 a.m. to 11:00 p.m.; no on-campus store alternative exists afterward. Only staff may use the Innovation Hub coffee machine, and the Engineering Store operator may increase evening staffing and inventory for additional demand."
